# The journey pnpm check plays for fb-055 on the replay brain: the check draws a labelled car by itself while this waits.
# A line of speech is not a target (a tap there does nothing, so the step is skipped), and of the alternatives the first label on stage is tapped: "Brakes", not "Wheel".
hold 8
tap? | The words beside a part can be tapped to ask about it
tap | Gearbox / Brakes / Wheel
rest
